<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.3 Ablation Studies and More Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Noise-Aware Few-Shot Learning through Bi-directional Multi-View Prompt Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Effect of selective label refinement</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px4" title="In 4.3 Ablation Studies and More Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Noise-Aware Few-Shot Learning through Bi-directional Multi-View Prompt Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis of multi-view prompts</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px5" title="In 4.3 Ablation Studies and More Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Noise-Aware Few-Shot Learning through Bi-directional Multi-View Prompt Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Difference from prior frameworks</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Noise-Aware Few-Shot Learning through Bi-directional Multi-View Prompt Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Noise-Aware Few-Shot Learning through Bi-directional Multi-View Prompt Alignment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
